<title>UK: UK CBI monthly trends enquiry due 1130 GMT Thurs.</title>
<headline>UK CBI monthly trends enquiry due 1130 GMT Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Confederation of British Industry (CBI) said it will release its January monthly trends enquiry at 1130 GMT on Thursday February 20 and not on Friday February 21 at 0030 GMT, as originally announced.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
